```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant CF_Edge as Edge Location (CF Function)
    participant CF_Regional as Regional Edge Cache
    participant Origin as S3 / ALB
    
    Client->>CF_Edge: GET /logo.png
    Note over CF_Edge: CF Function executes (e.g. normalize URL)
    
    alt In Edge Cache
        CF_Edge-->>Client: 200 OK (From Cache)
    else Not In Edge Cache
        CF_Edge->>CF_Regional: Request /logo.png
        alt In Regional Cache
            CF_Regional-->>CF_Edge: 200 OK (From Cache)
        else Not In Regional Cache
            CF_Regional->>Origin: Request /logo.png (OAC applied)
            Origin-->>CF_Regional: 200 OK
            Note over CF_Regional: Store in Regional Cache
        end
        Note over CF_Edge: Store in Edge Cache
        CF_Edge-->>Client: 200 OK
    end
```
